Data license (CC BY 4.0)
========================

The data files in this directory and its subdirectories (*.json, *.csv) —
the precomputed preflop equity tables for Texas Hold'em, Omaha and Omaha5,
including the exact heads-up tables and the hybrid multi-way tables — are
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(CC BY 4.0).

You are free to copy, share and adapt this data for any purpose, including
commercial use, provided you give appropriate credit.

Suggested attribution:

    Korttimestari preflop equity tables, (c) 2026 Riku,
    https://github.com/rikuxi/korttimestari — licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Computation methods and error bounds are documented per table in each
file's meta block and in data/README.md; the methodology summary is on
the site's methods page (/menetelmat.html, in English /en/methods.html).

The source code of this project is licensed separately under the MIT
license — see ../LICENSE.
